title: XVII Congress of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_full_name +]</span>
subtitle: A divergence in paths is to be decided once more.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1921 and month = 1
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/XVIICongress.jpg

= XVII Congress of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_full_name +]</span>

Debates and speeches from many are heard, as differing voices voice their opinions to the crowd. The 17th Congress of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_full_name +]</span> has begun. The agenda on the table is the 21 new conditions by the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CE0000">Communist International</span>, of which one has stood out: The expelling of the <span style="color:#FF6961">reformists</span>, now considered counter-revolutionaries.

The <span style="color:#DC143C">Maximalists</span> are caught in the centre, as the <span style="color:#8B0000">Communists</span> and <span style="color:#FF6961">Reformists</span> argue whether or not to toe the International line. It seems the party can no longer hold with compromise, one faction has to go.

- @refuse_comintern: The <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span> must stand with its <span style="color:#FF6961">reformists</span>. They will not be expelled.
- @accept_comintern: The <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span> must toe the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CE0000">Communist International</span> line. The <span style="color:#FF6961">Reformists</span> will be expelled.

@refuse_comintern
subtitle: It is likely the [? if pcdi_formed :remaining?] <span style="color:#8B0000">Communists</span> will split from the party.
choose-if: maximalist_participating = 1 or participating = 1 or pcdi_formed
unavailable-subtitle: [? if participating = 0 and maximalist_participating = 0: The XVI Congress has already forced us to adopt a revolutionary stance. ?]
on-arrival: communist_strength -= 100; communist_dissent += 100; pcdi_formed = 1; revolutionary_fervour -= 10; soviet_relations -= 3;

[? if communist_split = 1 : Even as the <span style="color:#8B0000">communists</span> faction remains minimal after the founding of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#C72F35">Italian Communist Party</span>, ?] The communist faction has resigned, with the majority [? if communist_split = 1 : joining the existing <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#C72F35">PCI</span>. ?][? if communist_split = 0 : creating a new party called the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#C72F35">Italian Communist Party</span>. ?] 

The <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CE0000">Communist International</span> has also expelled us, supporting the new <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#C72F35">PCI</span> instead; it seems we can no longer rely on them for aid.

